                              Step 1
                          </div>
                      </div>
                      <h3 class="font-extrabold text-gray-900 text-lg mb-1.5">Select a File</h3>
                      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed px-2">Pick any file or folder you want to protect.</p>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Step 2 -->
                  <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
                      <div class="relative mb-5">
                          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-blue rounded-full shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(37,99,235,0.3)] flex items-center justify-center text-white">
                              <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" /></svg>
                          </div>
                          <div class="absolute -bottom-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-white text-brand-blue text-[9px] font-extrabold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider whitespace-nowrap shadow-md border border-gray-100">
                              Step 2
                          </div>
                      </div>
                      <h3 class="font-extrabold text-gray-900 text-lg mb-1.5">Set a Password</h3>
                      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed px-2">Type a secure password to lock your items.</p>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Step 3 -->
                  <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
                      <div class="relative mb-5">
                          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-blue rounded-full shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(37,99,235,0.3)] flex items-center justify-center text-white">
                              <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
                          </div>
                          <div class="absolute -bottom-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-white text-brand-blue text-[9px] font-extrabold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider whitespace-nowrap shadow-md border border-gray-100">
                              Step 3
                          </div>
                      </div>
                      <h3 class="font-extrabold text-gray-900 text-lg mb-1.5">Save It</h3>
                      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed px-2">Download your newly protected file.</p>
                  </div>
              </div>
          </div>
      </div>
  </section>

  <!-- POPULAR USES -->
  <section class="w-full bg-[#f8fafc] py-20 px-6 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-6">What Can You Password Protect?</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10">
              FileLocker can be used to protect many types of files and folders, including:
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 mb-10">
              <span class="bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-medium">PDF documents</span>
              <span class="bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-medium">Word and Office files</span>
              <span class="bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-medium">Photos and personal images</span>
              <span class="bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-medium">Videos</span>
              <span class="bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-medium">ZIP and archive files</span>
              <span class="bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-medium">Work documents</span>
              <span class="bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-medium">Personal folders</span>
              <span class="bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-medium">Large files</span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-xl mx-auto text-lg leading-relaxed">
              You don't need a separate tool for every file type. Choose the file or folder you want to protect and create a password.
          </p>
      </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY USE FILELOCKER -->
  <section class="w-full bg-white py-20 px-6 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">Protect Files Without Installing Software</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg leading-relaxed text-center mb-12">
              Sometimes you only need to protect a file—you don't want to install a large application, create an account, or upload private files to an unknown server. FileLocker is designed for those situations.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
              
              <!-- Card 1 -->
              <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 bg-white flex flex-col group cursor-pointer hover:-translate-y-1">
                  <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-700 text-white relative overflow-hidden flex-1">
                      <div class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 w-24 h-24 bg-white opacity-10 rounded-full group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-500"></div>
                      <div class="absolute -left-8 -top-8 w-32 h-32 bg-white opacity-[0.05] rounded-full"></div>
                      
                      <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-10 relative z-10">
                          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-[0.8rem] bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center">
                              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                          </div>
                          <div class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">
                              100% FREE
                          </div>
                      </div>
                      
                      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 relative z-10">No Software</h3>
                      <p class="text-white/80 text-sm mb-2 relative z-10">Use the tool directly in your web browser.</p>
                      
                      <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all">
                          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" /></svg>
                      </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="px-5 py-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 bg-white relative z-10">
                      <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Highlight:</span>
                      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-600">No Downloads</span>
                  </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Card 2 -->
              <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 bg-white flex flex-col group cursor-pointer hover:-translate-y-1">
                  <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-400 to-orange-600 text-white relative overflow-hidden flex-1">
                      <div class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 w-24 h-24 bg-white opacity-10 rounded-full group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-500"></div>
                      <div class="absolute -left-8 -top-8 w-32 h-32 bg-white opacity-[0.05] rounded-full"></div>
                      
                      <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-10 relative z-10">
                          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-[0.8rem] bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center">
                              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" /></svg>
                          </div>
                          <div class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">
                              INSTANT
                          </div>
                      </div>
                      
                      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 relative z-10">No Account</h3>
                      <p class="text-white/80 text-sm mb-2 relative z-10">Start protecting files without signing up.</p>
                      
                      <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all">
                          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" /></svg>
                      </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="px-5 py-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 bg-white relative z-10">
                      <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Highlight:</span>
                      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-orange-600">Zero Friction</span>
                  </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Card 3 -->
              <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 bg-white flex flex-col group cursor-pointer hover:-translate-y-1">
                  <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500 to-pink-700 text-white relative overflow-hidden flex-1">
                      <div class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 w-24 h-24 bg-white opacity-10 rounded-full group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-500"></div>
                      <div class="absolute -left-8 -top-8 w-32 h-32 bg-white opacity-[0.05] rounded-full"></div>
                      
                      <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-10 relative z-10">
                          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-[0.8rem] bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center">
                              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" /></svg>
                          </div>
                          <div class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">
                              SECURE
                          </div>
                      </div>
                      
                      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 relative z-10">Stay Local</h3>
                      <p class="text-white/80 text-sm mb-2 relative z-10">Processed entirely on your device.</p>
                      
                      <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all">
                          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" /></svg>
                      </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="px-5 py-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 bg-white relative z-10">
                      <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Highlight:</span>
                      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-pink-600">Total Privacy</span>
                  </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Card 4 -->
              <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 bg-white flex flex-col group cursor-pointer hover:-translate-y-1">
                  <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-400 to-teal-600 text-white relative overflow-hidden flex-1">
                      <div class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 w-24 h-24 bg-white opacity-10 rounded-full group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-500"></div>
                      <div class="absolute -left-8 -top-8 w-32 h-32 bg-white opacity-[0.05] rounded-full"></div>
                      
                      <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-10 relative z-10">
                          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-[0.8rem] bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center">
                              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 7v10a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-6l-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2z" /></svg>
                          </div>
                          <div class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">
                              VERSATILE
                          </div>
                      </div>
                      
                      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 relative z-10">Any Format</h3>
                      <p class="text-white/80 text-sm mb-2 relative z-10">Lock single files or entire folders easily.</p>
                      
                      <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all">
                          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" /></svg>
                      </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="px-5 py-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 bg-white relative z-10">
                      <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Highlight:</span>
                      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-teal-600">Universal</span>
                  </div>
              </div>

          </div>
      </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LARGE FILES SECTION -->
  <section class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f8fafc] to-white py-20 px-6 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-6">Need to Password Protect a Large File?</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Large files can be difficult to protect using traditional online tools because many websites require you to upload the entire file before processing it.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10">
              FileLocker is designed to process files locally in your browser, helping you work with large documents, videos, archives, and other files without first uploading them to a server.
          </p>
          <a href="/lock-file" class="bg-brand-blue hover:bg-brand-blue-dark text-white font-bold py-4 px-10 rounded-full shadow-lg transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 transform active:scale-95 inline-block text-lg">
              Protect a Large File
          </a>
      </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ SECTION -->
  <section class="w-full bg-[#f8fafc] py-20 px-6 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-10 text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
              <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                  <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg">Is FileLocker free to use?</h4>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Yes. FileLocker provides browser-based tools for password protecting and opening supported FileLocker files.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                  <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg">Are my files uploaded to a server?</h4>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">No. FileLocker processes your files locally in your browser. Your selected files are not uploaded to a FileLocker server for processing.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                  <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg">Can I password protect a folder?</h4>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Yes. You can select a folder and protect its contents with a single password while preserving its folder structure.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                  <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg">What types of files can I protect?</h4>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">You can use FileLocker with many common file types, including documents, photos, videos, archives, and other files.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                  <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg">Can I protect large files?</h4>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">FileLocker is designed to work with large files by processing data in smaller parts instead of loading the entire file into memory at once.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                  <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg">Do I need to install software?</h4>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">No. FileLocker runs in your web browser, so there is no separate application to install.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-red-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-red-100 shadow-sm mt-8">
                  <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg flex items-center gap-2">
                      <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" /></svg>
                      What happens if I forget my password?
                  </h4>
                  <p class="text-gray-800 mt-2 leading-relaxed font-medium">FileLocker does not store your password. If you forget it, the protected file cannot be opened through FileLocker.</p>
              </div>
          </div>
      </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BOTTOM CTA SECTION -->
  <section class="w-full bg-brand-blue py-12 px-6 text-center">
